# Zip Inputs Live in `upload/`

- Put photo zip archives in the project `upload/` directory.
- CLI examples and docs should use paths like `upload/photos.zip`.
- Do not leave loose input zips at the repo root.
- Default GIF output (when `--output` is omitted) stays beside the zip under `upload/`.
